---
// Component: CredentialPrivacyDiagram
// Visualizes private credentials, zero-knowledge keys, and revocable project grants
---

<div class="credential-privacy-diagram" aria-label="Diagram showing how AI accounts are shared securely without credential exposure">
  <div class="privacy-flow">
    <!-- Step 1: Owner -->
    <div class="privacy-flow-node">
      <div class="privacy-node-icon">👤</div>
      <strong>AI Account Owner</strong>
      <span>Connects personal ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, or API Key</span>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Encrypted</span>
      <div class="arrow-line">→</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: Conclave Zero-Knowledge Vault -->
    <div class="privacy-flow-node privacy-flow-node--secure">
      <div class="privacy-node-icon">🛡️</div>
      <strong>Conclave Security Boundary</strong>
      <span>Keys stored encrypted · Never visible to collaborators or cloud clients</span>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Scoped grant</span>
      <div class="arrow-line">→</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3: Project Execution -->
    <div class="privacy-flow-node">
      <div class="privacy-node-icon">👥</div>
      <strong>Project Collaborators</strong>
      <span>Can prompt authorized AI · Zero secret visibility · Revocable anytime</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="privacy-grid">
    <div class="privacy-card">
      <span class="privacy-card-icon">🔒</span>
      <strong>Private by default</strong>
      <p>Your API keys, tokens, and OAuth sessions remain completely private. Collaborators never see your login credentials.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-card">
      <span class="privacy-card-icon">🎯</span>
      <strong>Scoped project grants</strong>
      <p>Authorize your AI Worker for a specific project only, rather than giving broad access to all your tools or personal data.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-card">
      <span class="privacy-card-icon">⚡</span>
      <strong>Instant revocation</strong>
      <p>Revoke access at any moment with a single click in your settings without having to rotate keys or change passwords.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-card">
      <span class="privacy-card-icon">📊</span>
      <strong>Clear attribution</strong>
      <p>Every turn and run clearly logs who requested work, which model answered, and token usage for full auditability.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
